datasets.anchor:
Datasets. We evaluate our module on the DomainBed benchmark (Gulrajani & Lopez-Paz, 2021),
using five widely adopted datasets: PACS (Li et al., 2017), OfficeHome (Venkateswara et al., 2017),
VLCS (Fang et al., 2013), Terra Incognita (Beery et al., 2018), and DomainNet (Peng et al., 2019).

Modular Arithmetic (w/o brackets) Given a sequence of digits in V and operators {+, −, ∗}
forming an arithmetic expression, output the result modulo |V |, respecting standard order
of operations.
